    "   {\n        r.at += 1;\n        return Ok(JsonText(JsonReader::text(r)?));\n    }\n    if (b == b'-' |"
    "| ascii_is_digit(b))\n    {\n        return JsonReader::number(r);\n    }\n    // A literal: the first b"
