    "ption::is_some(&o) && Option::unwrap(o) == 9);\n\u{1f}\u{1e}std::core\u{1f}Result::unwrap_or\u{1f}fn\u{1f}export fn Result::un"
    "wrap_or<T, E>(Result<T, E> r, T d) : T\u{1f}The value in `r`, or `d` when `r` is `Err`.\u{1f}\u{1f}export fn Result"
    "::unwrap_or<T, E>(Result<T, E> r, T d) : T\n    in `std::core`\n\n    The value in `r`, or `d` when `r`"
