    "\u{1f}export fn Result::unwrap<T, E>(Result<T, E> r) : T\u{1f}The value in `r`.\u{1f}\u{1f}export fn Result::unwrap<T, E"
    ">(Result<T, E> r) : T\n    in `std::core`\n\n    The value in `r`.\n\n    Faults (`unwrap_failed`) when `"
