    "wn.\n\u{1f}\u{1e}std::core\u{1f}Result::expect\u{1f}fn\u{1f}export fn Result::expect<T, E>(Result<T, E> r, str message) : T\u{1f}Th"
    "e value in `r`, faulting with `message` when `r` is an error.\u{1f}\u{1f}export fn Result::expect<T, E>(Result"
    "<T, E> r, str message) : T\n    in `std::core`\n\n    The value in `r`, faulting with `message` when `r"
