    " first element for which `p` returns true; `None` when there is none.\u{1f}\u{1f}export fn Vec::position<T>(re"
    "f<Vec<T>, shared> v, fn(ref<T, shared>) : bool p) : Option<usize>\n    in `std::collections`\n\n    The"
    " index of the first element for which `p` returns true; `None` when there is none.\n\n    `p` is calle"
    "d in index order and not past the first hit. `Vec::index_of` looks for an equal element.\n\n    Exampl"
    "e, \"Vec::position: first match\":\n        Vec<i32> v = Vec::new();\n        Vec::push(&mut v, 4);\n    "
