    "wrap(Vec::index_of(&v, six)) == 2);\n        assert(Option::is_none(&Vec::position(&v, [](ref<i32, sh"
    "ared> x) : bool { *x > 9 })));\n\u{1f}\u{1e}std::collections\u{1f}Vec::any\u{1f}fn\u{1f}export fn Vec::any<T>(ref<Vec<T>, shar"
    "ed> v, fn(ref<T, shared>) : bool p) : bool\u{1f}Whether `p` returns true for some element; `false` for an"
    " empty `Vec`.\u{1f}\u{1f}export fn Vec::any<T>(ref<Vec<T>, shared> v, fn(ref<T, shared>) : bool p) : bool\n    "
