    "   `p` is called in index order and not past the first element for which it returns true (D-0325).\n\u{1f}"
    "\u{1e}std::collections\u{1f}Vec::all\u{1f}fn\u{1f}export fn Vec::all<T>(ref<Vec<T>, shared> v, fn(ref<T, shared>) : bool"
    " p) : bool\u{1f}Whether `p` returns true for every element; `true` for an empty `Vec`.\u{1f}\u{1f}export fn Vec::al"
