    "ef<Vec<T>, shared> v, probe<T> x) : Option<usize>\n    in `std::collections`\n\n    The index of the fi"
    "rst element equal to what `x` probes; `None` when there is none.\n\n    `x` is the element's probe (D-"
    "0312): a view for a `Vec<String>` (a literal, a `str`, a view or `&s`), the\n    element itself for a"
