    ", so\n    they copy nothing: for a `HashMap<String, V>` a view, so a literal, a `str`, a view or `&s`"
    " looks a key up\n    without making a `String`; a number, `bool` or `str` key is passed itself (`Hash"
    "Map::get(&m, 7)`); a struct or\n    enum key by reference, `&k`. The map owns its keys and values and"
