    "hMap::clear<K, V>(ref<HashMap<K, V>, exclusive> m)\u{1f}Removes every entry of `m`, destroying them first"
    " to last, each entry's key and then its value.\u{1f}\u{1f}export fn HashMap::clear<K, V>(ref<HashMap<K, V>, ex"
    "clusive> m)\n    in `std::collections`\n\n    Removes every entry of `m`, destroying them first to last"
