    "ref<HashMap<K, V>, exclusive> m, K k, V v) : Option<V>\u{1f}Adds key `k` with value `v`; returns the old "
    "value if `k` was already present, otherwise `None`.\u{1f}\u{1f}export fn HashMap::insert<K, V>(ref<HashMap<K, "
