    "oid, T>\n    in `std::sync`\n\n    Puts `v` at the back of `ch`, waiting while the channel is full.\n\n  "
    "  `Err(v)`, the value handed back, once the channel is closed. Exclusive references inside `v` are l"
    "ent to\n    the receiving thread: the sender's own copies of them clash with them while they live.\n\u{1f}\u{1e}"
