    ">\u{1f}Takes the value at the front of `ch` if one is waiting, without waiting.\u{1f}\u{1f}export fn Channel::try_r"
    "ecv<T>(ref<Channel<T>, shared> ch) : Result<Option<T>, void>\n    in `std::sync`\n\n    Takes the value"
    " at the front of `ch` if one is waiting, without waiting.\n\n    `Ok(Some(v))` with the value; `Ok(Non"
    "e)` when the channel is empty; `Err(())` once it is closed and empty,\n    so a loop that also polls "
