    "d::sync`\n\n    How many threads the machine runs at once, at least 1: the size of a worker pool.\n\n   "
    " The processors, or what this program may use of them.\n\u{1f}\u{1e}std::sync\u{1f}Channel::close\u{1f}fn\u{1f}export fn Chann"
