    "\u{1f}BigUint::to_bytes_be_padded\u{1f}fn\u{1f}export fn BigUint::to_bytes_be_padded(ref<BigUint, shared> a, usize "
    "width) : Vec<u8>\u{1f}The big-endian bytes of `a` in exactly `width` bytes, zeros in front.\u{1f}\u{1f}export fn Bi"
    "gUint::to_bytes_be_padded(ref<BigUint, shared> a, usize width) : Vec<u8>\n    in `std::math`\n    requ"
    "ires\n        BigUint::bit_len(a) <= width * 8, arith_overflow\n\n    The big-endian bytes of `a` in ex"
    "actly `width` bytes, zeros in front.\n\n    Faults (`arith_overflow`) when `a` needs more than `width`"
    " bytes.\n\n    Example, \"BigUint::to_bytes_be_padded: minimal and padded bytes\":\n        BigUint x = B"
