    "rt(Vec::len(&min) == 2 && min[0] == 1);\n        Vec<u8> wide = BigUint::to_bytes_be_padded(&x, 4);\n "
    "       assert(Vec::len(&wide) == 4 && wide[0] == 0 && wide[3] == 2);\n        assert(Vec::len(&BigUin"
    "t::to_bytes_be(&BigUint::zero())) == 0);\n\u{1f}\u{1e}std::math\u{1f}BigUint::is_zero\u{1f}fn\u{1f}export fn BigUint::is_zero("
    "ref<BigUint, shared> a) : bool\u{1f}Whether `a` is 0.\u{1f}\u{1f}export fn BigUint::is_zero(ref<BigUint, shared> a)"
    " : bool\n    in `std::math`\n\n    Whether `a` is 0.\n\u{1f}\u{1e}std::math\u{1f}BigUint::bit_len\u{1f}fn\u{1f}export fn BigUint:"
    ":bit_len(ref<BigUint, shared> a) : usize\u{1f}The number of bits needed to write `a`; 0 for zero.\u{1f}\u{1f}export"
