    "::math\u{1f}BigDivision\u{1f}struct\u{1f}export struct BigDivision\u{1f}The quotient and remainder that `BigUint::div_re"
    "m` gives.\u{1f}\u{1f}export struct BigDivision\n    in `std::math`\n\n    The quotient and remainder that `BigUin"
    "t::div_rem` gives.\n\n    Taken apart by destructuring: `BigDivision { quotient, remainder } = BigUint"
