    "ision\u{1f}The quotient of `a` by `b`, rounded down, and the remainder, together.\u{1f}\u{1f}export fn BigUint::div"
    "_rem(ref<BigUint, shared> a, ref<BigUint, shared> b) : BigDivision\n    in `std::math`\n    requires\n "
