    "on failed.\n\n    - `Refused`: nothing listens at the address connected to.\n    - `Reset`: the peer re"
    "set the connection.\n    - `TimedOut`: the socket's timeout passed; the socket is still usable.\n    -"
    " `Unreachable`: the address cannot be reached.\n    - `AddrInUse`: the address to bind is already in "
    "use.\n    - `AddrNotAvailable`: the address to bind cannot be used on this machine.\n    - `UnknownHos"
    "t`: the name resolves to nothing or cannot be resolved.\n    - `NotPermitted`: the system denied perm"
    "ission.\n    - `Closed`: the peer has gone while writing, or a `read_exact` was cut short.\n    - `NoD"
    "escriptors`: the program, or the system, has as many files and sockets open as it may.\n    - `Messag"
    "eTooLong`: a datagram is larger than the socket can send.\n    - `Failed`: any other failure.\n    - `"
    "NotUtf8(e)`: a line `read_line` read is not UTF-8.\n\n    No variant shares a name with `FileError`'s,"
