    "derstood, or\n      critical name constraints hold a subtree of a form other than `dNSName` and `iPAd"
    "dress`, so the\n      certificate is not usable. The `dNSName` and `iPAddress` name constraints are k"
    "ept for `verify_chain`.\n    - `key`: the subject's public key.\n\n    Not independently audited: `std:"
    ":x509` is implemented to the standards its documentation names, tested\n    against OpenSSL, and fuzz"
