    "ort fn certificates_from_pem(StringView text) : Vec<Certificate>\n    in `std::x509`\n\n    Every certi"
    "ficate in the PEM `text`, in order: its `-----BEGIN CERTIFICATE-----` blocks (RFC 7468).\n\n    Text b"
