    "c::len(&certs) == 0);\n\u{1f}\u{1e}std::x509\u{1f}TrustStore\u{1f}struct\u{1f}export struct TrustStore\u{1f}The root certificates a"
    " chain may end at, for `verify_chain`.\u{1f}\u{1f}export struct TrustStore\n    in `std::x509`\n\n    The root ce"
    "rtificates a chain may end at, for `verify_chain`.\n\n    `roots` may be read and changed directly; `T"
