    "rom_der(slice<u8, shared> der) : Result<CertKey, CertError>\u{1f}The public key of the DER SubjectPublicK"
    "eyInfo `der`.\u{1f}\u{1f}export fn CertKey::from_der(slice<u8, shared> der) : Result<CertKey, CertError>\n    i"
