    "}\");\n\u{1f}\u{1e}std::database::postgres\u{1f}PgError\u{1f}enum\u{1f}export enum PgError\u{1f}Why a PostgreSQL connection or state"
    "ment failed.\u{1f}\u{1f}export enum PgError\n    in `std::database::postgres`\n\n    Why a PostgreSQL connection "
    "or statement failed.\n\n    - `PgNetFailure(e)`: connecting, reading or writing failed; `e` says how.\n"
    "    - `PgTlsFailure(e)`: the TLS handshake or the encrypted stream failed.\n    - `TlsRefused`: the s"
    "erver does not accept TLS, and the URL asks for `verify-full`.\n    - `NoTrustedRoots`: the system's "
    "trusted roots could not be loaded.\n    - `BadConnectionUrl`: the URL is malformed (`PgUrl::parse`).\n"
    "    - `UnsupportedAuth`: the server asks for a method other than SCRAM-SHA-256 or a password over TL"
    "S.\n    - `AuthRefused`: the server asks for the password in clear over an unencrypted connection.\n  "
    "  - `AuthFailed`: the server refused the credentials, or failed to prove it knows them.\n    - `Serve"
    "r(e)`: the server reported an error; the connection stays usable, unless the server ended the\n      "
    "session with it (a `FATAL` error, such as `57P01` when an administrator terminated the session).\n   "
    " - `ProtocolViolation`: a message from the server is malformed or not allowed at that point.\n    - `"
    "ResultTooLarge`: the rows exceed `max_result`, or more than 65 535 parameters were given.\n    - `Dis"
    "connected`: the stream ended, or the connection was closed or broken by an earlier failure.\n    - `U"
    "nsupported(what)`: the statement needs what this client does not do, as `what` says: `COPY` (the\n   "
    "   connection stays usable), or a `client_encoding` other than `UTF8` (the connection is closed, sin"
    "ce\n      text sent and received would no longer be UTF-8).\n\n    Variants:\n        PgNetFailure(NetEr"
    "ror)\n        PgTlsFailure(TlsError)\n        TlsRefused\n        NoTrustedRoots\n        BadConnectionU"
    "rl\n        UnsupportedAuth\n        AuthRefused\n        AuthFailed\n        Server(PgServerError)\n    "
    "    ProtocolViolation\n        ResultTooLarge\n        Disconnected\n        Unsupported(str)\n\u{1f}\u{1e}std::da"
