    " Its errors include `BadConnectionUrl`, `PgNetFailure` when no address connects, `TlsRefused`,\n    `"
    "PgTlsFailure`, `UnsupportedAuth`, `AuthRefused`, `AuthFailed`, `Server` and `ProtocolViolation`.\n\u{1f}\u{1e}s"
