    "               : assert(false),\n        }\n\u{1f}\u{1e}std::encoding::json\u{1f}Json::text\u{1f}fn\u{1f}export fn Json::text(r"
    "ef<Json, shared> j) : String\u{1f}The value `j` as compact JSON text: no white space, members and element"
