    "onMember>, shared> members = Option::unwrap(Json::as_object(&o));\n        usize k = *Option::unwrap("
    "HashMap::get(&at, \"k777\"));\n        assert(Json::as_f64(&members[k].value) == Some(777.0));\n\n    Exa"
