    "o a branch that calls `exit` needs no value of its own. `fn main() : u8`'s return\n    value is the o"
    "rdinary way to set the status; `exit` is for deep inside a program.\n\u{1f}\u{1e}std::math\u{1f}sqrt\u{1f}built in fn\u{1f}fn "
